::BeforeSupplyChainCh7
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Research)
@cutscene 
@once
                                               
//dial tone              
{@Mai}      ...Hi.
{@Player}   Hi.
{@Mai}      ...I'm Mai.
{@Player}   I'm Locke...
{@Mai}      Like... an Air-Lock? 
{@Player}   Uh, no. It has an E at the end. 
{@Mai}      Did your parents dislike you?
{@Player}   Excuse me?  
{@Mai}      I'm the supplier contact for the...
{@Mai}      "Recently liberated" Wolfram. 
{@Player}   Oh, the factory planet? 
{@Mai}      Yeah, sure, if that's what you want to call it. 
{@Player}   Oh, I didn't mean that, I- you're planet isn't just a factory planet- 
{@Mai}      You're funny. 
{@Mai}      If you need anything from my sector, call me. 
{@Player}   Will do...
//hang up tone. 
{@Quinn}    Wow. That was rough. 
{@Joel}     I've been taking an improv class if you want to join me Locke. 
{@Joel}     Maybe that can help with your social skills!
{@Player}   Thanks... I'll think about it. 

::AfterSupplyChain
@trigger 
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Supply)
@cutscene 
@once 
//dial tone 
{@Taryn}    Hey Locke! 
{@Player}   Taryn! Haven't heard from you for a while. 
{@Taryn}    Yeah sorry, the festival took up a lot of my time. 
{@Taryn}    That and the protests...
{@Player}   How... are things on Kalvis? 
{@Taryn}    Tense. But positive.
{@Taryn}    I've been in charge of putting together a food-drive for the families of miners affected in the collapse. 
{@Taryn}    Any and all business with us will help fund the food-drive, so you're business would be greatly appreciated! 
{@Player}   That's... really awesome. 
{@Taryn}    Oh, might as well let you know that our Phosphorus production is back. 
{@Taryn}    You might experience some issues given the lockdowns, but Kalvis is in full swing again. 
{@Player}   Thanks Taryn. 
{@Taryn}    Yup yup! Gotta go, cya!
